-- Seed: 24 HVAC businesses for the directory (6 each for Austin, Dallas, Houston and San Antonio areas).
-- Run AFTER schema-directory.sql. Safe to re-run (existing slugs are skipped).
-- Source: each business's own website, checked 2026-10-28. See docs/listing-sources.md. Review before relying on it:
-- licensing, insurance and availability are NOT verified, and listings are not endorsements.

on conflict (slug) do nothing;

